{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/f6e95d45ee2d148071906fc194665718.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=616 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/f6e95d45ee2d148071906fc194665718.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy meets physics, in this <strong>roguelike word game</strong>, where you combine spelling with cool upgrades to score high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge letters, spell big words, trigger upgrades, drink potions, wield wands and restore order!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft long words to score high</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/811c83706fe1602d37a62547590e51de.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1056 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/811c83706fe1602d37a62547590e51de.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge, merge, merge = more points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/6d2266431c002806c9be3b15b63a6079.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=998 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/6d2266431c002806c9be3b15b63a6079.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose specific words to trigger cool upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/a29fce606b4ad3678a2ec294558a9aa9.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1044 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/a29fce606b4ad3678a2ec294558a9aa9.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat bosses with mind twisting rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/546a6f0f5ba3bef2466cb79b1a9f51f3.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1040 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/546a6f0f5ba3bef2466cb79b1a9f51f3.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than a roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various game modes: roguelike, time rush, jar puzzle and daily challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; relaxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, grab a hot drink, and  spell your way to victory while listening to chill music made by Trevron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact how you want</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse, keyboard, touchscreen or controller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Dashpong, Hyperslice and many action oriented jam games, I wanted to work on something more chill. I've been thinking about creating a word game for a while, and I'm super happy to explore a new direction with Lexispell. The goal is to make a small and cozy word game that can also be challenging for avid gamers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm making this alone, with help from Trevron for the music, so don't hesitate to share and wishlist Lexispell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you'll enjoy :) - Eliptik</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053960?t=1774131505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/63e5a8e776c0a7c7e779de6442de5418d2e9319b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774131505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/fa745eb40284ec87b3c425f9bb1c2372fca32e2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774131505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/fa745eb40284ec87b3c425f9bb1c2372fca32e2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774131505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4053980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/f6e95d45ee2d148071906fc194665718.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=616 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/f6e95d45ee2d148071906fc194665718.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy meets physics, in this <strong>roguelike word game</strong>, where you combine spelling with cool upgrades to score high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge letters, spell big words, trigger upgrades, drink potions, wield wands and restore order!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft long words to score high</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/811c83706fe1602d37a62547590e51de.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1056 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/811c83706fe1602d37a62547590e51de.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge, merge, merge = more points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/6d2266431c002806c9be3b15b63a6079.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=998 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/6d2266431c002806c9be3b15b63a6079.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose specific words to trigger cool upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/a29fce606b4ad3678a2ec294558a9aa9.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1044 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/a29fce606b4ad3678a2ec294558a9aa9.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat bosses with mind twisting rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/546a6f0f5ba3bef2466cb79b1a9f51f3.poster.avif?t=1774131505\" width=1040 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/extras/546a6f0f5ba3bef2466cb79b1a9f51f3.webm?t=1774131505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than a roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various game modes: roguelike, time rush, jar puzzle and daily challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; relaxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, grab a hot drink, and  spell your way to victory while listening to chill music made by Trevron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact how you want</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse, keyboard, touchscreen or controller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Dashpong, Hyperslice and many action oriented jam games, I wanted to work on something more chill. I've been thinking about creating a word game for a while, and I'm super happy to explore a new direction with Lexispell. The goal is to make a small and cozy word game that can also be challenging for avid gamers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm making this alone, with help from Trevron for the music, so don't hesitate to share and wishlist Lexispell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you'll enjoy :) - Eliptik</p>","developers":["MrEliptik"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/c2bfc8706b0a665fd694637ed147a541e61bc33d/header.jpg?t=1774131505","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64bits linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core, 2Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64bits linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core, 2Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/621957888/d369e713d1b298ee31073fd616b941879ca83c4f/1772876215/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772879670","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/621957888/d369e713d1b298ee31073fd616b941879ca83c4f/1772876215/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772879670","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/621957888/d369e713d1b2